  {journeyIds:['LJ-10'],testId:'book-publication-provenance',scope:'Actually admitted Books share the same Portable bytes in different Manifest orders. SQLite/Wasm facts retain exact positions without duplicate Packages. Partial recovery, only-missing-source retry, warm no-download recovery, lost cache position repair and concurrent genuine source admission with its disposable publication removed never falsely report complete. Explicit non-primary Book enrollment passes cacheless backup domain validation; forged Book/duplicate positions reject. Final SQLite write failure rolls back facts and both projections. Controlled cacheless-concurrency setup, not Cloud transport, Learning outcomes, Range/mode UI, OPFS latency, authored learning-order or publisher trust.'},
