  {journeyIds:['LJ-08','LJ-16'],testId:'library-sync-transport',scope:'Public sync interface with SQLite/Wasm and controlled malformed transport rejects an unrequested missing hash without head-race retry or learner-fact mutation. An unversioned confirmed baseline cannot skip the current manifest format gate; incompatible data remains untouched with a terminal failure. No HTTP, OPFS, provider, capacity or heap claim.'},
  {journeyIds:['LJ-08','LJ-16'],testId:'library-sync-blocks',scope:'Lossless deterministic transport encoding reuses immutable body segments without merging row identities or clocks. UTF-8 chunk boundaries preserve surrogate pairs; corrupt digests, invalid base64, forged inflation sizes and truncated-prefix attacks reject. Pure codec evidence, not real cloud, browser latency, capacity or history replay.'},
  {journeyIds:['LJ-08'],testId:'shared-learning-storage',scope:'Actual Initial and due Review commands over SQLite/Wasm share immutable content across Target/Run snapshots without merging their identities or times. Failed compatible admission rolls back source, indexes, receipts and content owners together; sync baseline owns exact bodies through local clearing. Corrupt body reads fail closed. Framed shared/gzip backup rejects missing/corrupt/orphan/duplicate/truncated frames before writes and encrypted empty-destination restore preserves genuine cacheless history. Synthetic low media and controlled storage; not OPFS latency, large capacity, audio quality or Cloud transfer normalization.'},
  {journeyIds:['LJ-08'],testId:'local-learning-runtime',scope:'Controlled formal Protocol fixtures retain distinct Initial Completion, due Review and Relearning authority. Genuine cacheless Structured backups still check exact rehashed Run material source admission and presentation times; moving Ready before source admission/after Run start, or moving a refreshed snapshot/source after its actual presentation event rejects. Does not establish complete Structured replay without its resources or a shipped Structured user entry; that capability remains outside current Web acceptance.'},
  {journeyIds:['LJ-08'],testId:'personal-learning',scope:'Real personal preparation through controlled model/speech adapters records the Content Attempt actual Ready instant and transfers it unchanged to admitted material. Backdated Run creation rejects with all source, Target, Run, active-selection and receipt tables unchanged; actual private-to-published material refresh history remains restorable without package cache. No paid providers, shipped UI or capacity claim.'},
