  {journeyIds:['LJ-07'],testId:'portable-package-loop',scope:'Real Portable admission and explicit compatible update retain the Target and acted experience version while refreshing an unacted reveal Step. Runtime question resources use that actual prior experience plus current bound reveal resources, not revised unadopted cues. Controlled Library and restore validation, not browser update UX.'},
