  {journeyIds:['LJ-03'],testId:'personal-meaning-journey',scope:'Manual creation through shipped UI, without model configuration or calls: required Context, explicit repeated-occurrence choice, recoverable draft, explicit offline acceptance, ordinary detail and reload; no implicit learning. Empty and synthetic 10k OPFS libraries guard cold-save boundedness.'},
  {journeyIds:['LJ-03'],testId:'extension-intake-journey',scope:'Installed unpacked extension and shipped Web in isolated persistent Chromium with real OPFS: pointer selection followed by keyboard extension, controlled local-model HTTP lookup, explicit extension acceptance while Web is closed, guest durable queue, Web bridge receipt, direct Meaning without a second acceptance or learning enrollment, browser close/reopen and exact receipt preservation. A separate unconfirmed capture is applied to Inbox with its source and continuation action; reload preserves the Inbox and exact receipts without another model request. Model response is controlled; not live-model quality, third-party site compatibility, authenticated server queue or Agent delivery evidence.'},
  {journeyIds:['LJ-03'],testId:'world-readers',scope:'UI read module with controlled asynchronous Library: bounded 512-summary/choice window, single-flight page reads, frame/incarnation invalidation, late-response fencing, shared exact-detail subscription, failure and explicit retry. Compact select-all enumerates the whole coherent result and rejects concurrent revision/replacement or cancellation without partial selection. No DOM, SQLite or provider evidence. Inbox snapshot reads share the same late-result, loading/error/retry and detach guards.'},
  {journeyIds:['LJ-03'],testId:'scoped-context-command',scope:'Actual command gateway and Library repository with controlled storage: synthetic 1k scoped Context writes, new Inbox drafts and first clarification acceptance forbid source enumeration. Exact replay precedes source reads; changed retries, stale fixed versions, missing root and replaced incarnation reject without a receipt. Context/draft scopes forbid registry changes; acceptance permits only the original command registry delta, one new Meaning and removal of the original draft, preserving distant Binding ordinals. Existing and absent Sense/Expression selections are rechecked under the writer lock; racing namespace selection rejects without consuming the Inbox and an explicit retry can succeed. Canonical sentence and utterance_strategy Expression types remain accepted. Indexed identity reservation prevents allocation/commit races and operation/media collisions; Context/draft media rollback stays atomic. Unrelated foreign writes survive, queued global reload cannot deadlock, and semantic-only refresh cannot hide Inbox changes. Controlled adapter evidence, not native SQL complexity, OPFS, browser paint or provider evidence.'},
