  {journeyIds:['LJ-03'],testId:'world-browse-storage',scope:'Actual SQLite/Wasm private World read index: bounded compact pages and learning-choice pins, multiple accepted bindings per Meaning, target-language separation, literal/NFKC Context search, exact phase/label projection, pinned heads, corrupted dependency rejection/repair, cache-only rebuild and World/choice index failure atomic rollback. Synthetic 10k verifies page/search/choice reads do not read source aggregates or transport full Context/media, and checks the compact UUID identity index physical footprint with SQLite dbstat. Not shipped UI, browser/OPFS paint or model evidence. Pending-only reads use a partial index; controlled projection rows exercise both unfinished-Sense and unbound-Expression branches, ordering and pagination without reading source aggregates.'},
  {journeyIds:['LJ-03'],testId:'personal-meaning-journey',scope:'Shipped UI, real Chromium and OPFS with controlled compatible-provider SSE: reply/candidate disclosure, explicit acceptance and optional learning, actionable schema correction, incomplete-stream and original Inbox draft recovery. After an initial unavailable provider, configuring a teacher in the same document and explicitly continuing through Inbox resumes the saved draft; this does not persist page-only credentials across reload. Material changed during a held model stream or review blocks the original proposal across reload; only explicit continuation with fresh material can confirm, without implicit duplicate provider calls. A synthetic learner photo appended through the actual input produces identical normalized JPEG bytes in the controlled teacher HTTP request, authoritative Media row and accepted detail across reload; this does not prove live image interpretation. Held detail read preserves unsaved Context input; a foreign Context write preserves the editor and rejects stale overwrite while original capture remains visible. Synthetic 10k World top/bottom real-row windows, header-height remeasurement, first exact detail before batch/commands without full-gateway hydration, full-result batch selection, NFKC search, committed Context edit/reload and inactive practice preference preservation. After reload, actual add-content/conversation/send and explicit new Sense/Expression acceptance avoid full-gateway hydration; separate local-save and click-to-visible-detail budgets exclude the controlled teacher reply, and the accepted detail survives reload without automatic learning enrollment. Not unsaved-input recovery after full reload, real provider, external capture, all-scale Inbox opening or Agent delivery; registration is not a passing performance result. At 10k confirmed Meanings plus one pending material, the actual Inbox drawer exposes held loading, injected read failure and explicit retry, then displays the saved material without full-gateway hydration.'},
  {journeyIds:['LJ-03','LJ-15'],testId:'practice-source-loading',scope:'Actual scope hook and practice screens in isolated Chromium/OPFS: held source read and missing-version fault keep the saved Personal preference, disable provisional fallback activities, preserve detached session scope, fail closed on retry while still broken and recover on a repaired storage notification. Actual Package hook initial-load/retry with a controlled Learning workspace read failure; Route revision change is loading before passive reload effects and queue idempotency includes the exact pinned language context. Synthetic Current Study resolver input, not formal learning/runtime or full workspace navigation evidence.'},
  {journeyIds:['LJ-03'],testId:'semantic-lookup',scope:'Actual gateway and confirmed-fact index with MemoryJourneyRepository: reuse identity/version/boundaries, pins, foreign merge/deletion, atomic witnesses, exact object/void replay, unavailable/replaced Library state, private prose exclusion and 32KiB tool budget. Proposal source witness rejects changed Meaning/Inbox and mismatched incarnation, guards draft metadata under the commit lock, allows an explicitly rechecked source after an unobserved foreign change, and preserves exact receipt replay. Synthetic 10k World/detail/source identity reads reject per-Meaning registry scans. Node timings are not browser/OPFS/model or paint evidence.'},
  {journeyIds:['LJ-03'],testId:'semantic-lookup-opfs',scope:'Real Chromium/shared SQLite OPFS, production gateway/repository: cold scoped Context writes forbid semantic enumeration, bound exact-row reads, preserve foreign Inbox writes and exact replay, and reject stale revisions or missing fixed dependencies across tabs without a receipt. New draft appends among synthetic 1k Meanings read no Meaning/registry facts. First acceptance preserves unrelated Inbox changes, converges on one same-operation receipt across tabs, and rejects a missing fixed version during a held commit without consuming its source. Reload preserves the complete committed checkpoint. Subscribed World/Inbox invalidation, stale-frame merge, fixed-version pins, concurrent deletion and stale proposal/material rejection remain independently covered. Synthetic 10k first clarification acceptance has separate command-completion and heartbeat budgets; it is not click-to-paint evidence. First-after-write lookup and persisted 100/1k/10k lookup after Chromium relaunch exercise post-bulk WAL maintenance with heartbeat budgets. Private World repository compact 40-row page, NFKC/private Context search and selected aggregate detail at synthetic 10k; not model latency or full World page rendering. An independent Inbox subscriber among 1k confirmed Meanings follows cross-tab creation/dismissal, reattaches after missed changes and survives reload while its command gateway remains cold.'},
